    "Getting started: install extras ([http], [s3], [sftp], [encryption], [oauth1]) and the base-install surface, then a one-call read/write via the root storage() factory and StorageFacade.",
    "Backend support matrix per protocol including RangedRead (local, S3 family, SFTP, HTTP; GCS/Azure/FTP/SMB/GitHub are settings-only).",
